<div style="max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 20px;">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;">

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">🚚</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Standard Shipping</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Standard shipping within the UAE takes 3–5 business days. Orders are processed within 1–2 business days before dispatch.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">⚡</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Express Shipping</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Express shipping is available at checkout for delivery within 1–2 business days. Express orders placed before 12pm are prioritized for same-day dispatch.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">🎁</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Free Shipping</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Enjoy free standard shipping on all orders over AED 400. For orders below this amount, a flat shipping fee will be calculated at checkout based on your location.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">🌍</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>International Shipping</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">We ship to most countries worldwide. International orders typically arrive within 7–14 business days. Please note that customs duties and import taxes may apply depending on your country.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">📦</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Order Tracking</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Once your order is dispatched, you will receive a shipping confirmation email with a tracking number to monitor your delivery in real time.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">📋</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Important Notes</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Delivery times may be affected by public holidays or high-demand periods. If you have not received your order within the expected timeframe, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@nichey.store" style="color:#1a1a1a;">hello@nichey.store</a></span></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

